WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for disc01_10h.avi
Scene: Fisherman's Horizon crash sequence
Estimated duration: 28 seconds
No dialogue in this scene

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Balamb Garden drifts without full control toward the horizon. The massive floating facility moves slowly through the sky.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Fisherman's Horizon comes into view ahead. The unique solar-powered town is built on a massive horizontal bridge structure that spans the ocean.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The town consists of large solar panel arrays, industrial cranes, metal walkways, and small residential structures built directly into the bridge framework.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Garden approaches steadily. The enormous ring-shaped facility descends toward the town. The scale difference is dramatic.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Impact occurs. Balamb Garden crashes into the edge of Fisherman's Horizon. The massive hull scrapes against the metal structures of the town.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Sparks and debris fly as the Garden grinds against the platform. The impact creates tremendous noise and vibration throughout both structures.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The Garden comes to a halt against Fisherman's Horizon. Residents scatter in alarm from the collision. Both structures shake with the force of the crash.
